    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:450c5c9e93d67b75ca608b96",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "使用殿堂赛马娘挑战每日比赛吧。\\n根据挑战的比赛可获得各种报酬。\\n每天入场券会回复至<color=#ff9900>最大张数</color>。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e0d854e0851e98064f24bb8e1143818f78f1a23a9ec6a8f72b6c69759a65116d",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "63",
        "24"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/63/24"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8bb3e106b3520f5a411db06d",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "<color=#ff9900>大丰食祭</color>是一项让赛马娘们展示自己拿手料理的活动。\\n3年内的4次试吃会过后，将举办大丰食祭！\\n为了让参加试吃会与大丰食祭料理挑战的\\n赛马娘们获得<color=#ff9900>大满足</color>，去制作与品尝更多的料理，\\n提升自己的料理水平吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "8c23b5e8307327ad3f34843babc1d1ae8a08fc9fae56e634861f7b23fed8b27b",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "63",
        "240"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/63/240"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3ffd45d7e427cc9403e66a08",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "制作料理可以获得<color=#ff9900>料理Pt</color>。\\n获得<color=#ff9900>各项料理挑战</color>所需的一定数量的料理Pt后，\\n赛马娘将得到更好的成长！\\n此外，料理Pt上升后，还会发生训练效果提升、\\n得意率提升等效果，从而促进赛马娘的成长！",
      "source_fingerprint": "87e18cc0fd7a33e9b25c79bd59f1338338dd3aa2ad5af9267901e5362dec1a9d",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "63",
        "241"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/63/241"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8683f8a8dd979d2057f5b6ef",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "每4个回合后都将<color=#ff9900>收获5种蔬菜</color>，并获得<color=#ff9900>农田Pt</color>！\\n另外，进行训练、休息、外出等活动时，\\n将获得<color=#ff9900>打理印章</color>，增加相对应的蔬菜的收获数！\\n此外，在友情训练等活动中还将获得<color=#ff9900>全力打理印章</color>，\\n所有蔬菜的收获数都将增加！",
      "source_fingerprint": "26645f5cd71f13bfd04c279062582950a71cf78998b112cb0871b3a00a9c31e7",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
